-2.742798                alpha0      ! 0-lift angle of attack, depends on airfoil.
14.235844                alpha1      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-11.738881               alpha2      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
